"Download the AI Visual model? %1, %2 MB, from huggingface.co (OpenAI CLIP "
"ViT-B/32, MIT licence). It is checked against its published SHA-256 and kept "
"in ~/.local/share/sumi/models."
msgstr ""
"Pobrać model AI Visual? %1, %2 MB, z huggingface.co (OpenAI CLIP ViT-B/32, "
"licencja MIT). Model jest sprawdzany względem opublikowanej sumy SHA-256 i "
"przechowywany w ~/.local/share/sumi/models."

